Hi Sharon

don't use root privileges to install R and its package, but rather, 
create a dedicated user account and group for that, and make yourself 
member of that group.

There is no advantage in using the root account for installing R, and 
some potential security and system safety risks.

	Best wishes
	Wolfgang


