I did

> example(readAligned)
> aln = readAligned(ap, "s_2_export.txt", "SolexaExport")
> aln1 = aln[!is.na(position(aln))]
> cvg = coverage(aln1)

> I know there are 8497 unique reference transcripts I am aligning to,
